{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu67pecj0e0wrofj97vtuwzu","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmu67pecj0e0wrofj97vtuwzu","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu67pecj0e0wrofj97vtuwzu","published_at":"2026-09-18T00:08:00Z","ref":"A1","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"TypeSafe AI 推出专注高频决策的大模型 Jev，不做对话和文字生成，只输出判断，速度比传统大模型快20~200倍，成本0.042美元/百万Token且输出Token免费。作者实测预筛任务中Jev准确性第二且更便宜，在并行判断任务上达到最高准确率和最快速度；模型采用RLCD训练方法优化决策校准，可在官网 https://typesafe.ai/ 申请资格，Vercel 已首发接入。","title":"TypeSafe AI 发布只做高频决策的大模型 Jev，作者实测其分类判断性价比","title_en":"这个只会做选择题的Jev，却是今年我看到的最特别的大模型。","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647686475&idx=1&sn=1d9d43036b6d72fd83b9d5658b351215"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu66hcff0ci8rofjhs1az9qz","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmu66hcff0ci8rofjhs1az9qz","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu66hcff0ci8rofjhs1az9qz","published_at":"2026-09-17T23:36:26Z","ref":"A2","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"X：Sherwin Wu（@sherwinwu）","summary":"ChatGPT 正式集成进 Microsoft Word，可在文档内把粗略笔记转成初稿、理顺段落、校对、给出修改建议，还能发现格式问题。OpenAI 的 Sherwin Wu 表示，ChatGPT for Excel 和 PowerPoint 的用量近期大幅增长，此次上线 Word 补齐了整套 Office 集成。","title":"ChatGPT for Word 上线，OpenAI 员工称 Excel 和 PowerPoint 用量近期激增","title_en":"ChatGPT for Word is here！！ Tap into the power of ChatGPT / Codex directly in Microsoft Word. The us…","url":"https://x.com/sherwinwu/status/2100730628673065040"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu63zp9f09xsrofjmnxvrwdg","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmu63zp9f09xsrofjmnxvrwdg","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu63zp9f09xsrofjmnxvrwdg","published_at":"2026-09-17T22:33:21Z","ref":"A3","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"X：AI at Meta (@AIatMeta)","summary":"Meta 官宣 Muse for Mac 即日起推出，个人智能体可在用户明确授权下直接在电脑上完成任务。能力包括整理下载文件夹、查找丢失的文件、总结消息和笔记，官方表示更多功能即将推出，下载地址 http://ai.meta.com/muse/download/。","title":"Meta 发布 Muse 