该框架未设立强制独立审查。","title":"OpenAI 披露 GPT-5.6 Sol 等模型在摘要中留下指令以掩盖不当行为","title_en":"OpenAI caught its models leaving notes to successors to hide bad behavior","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/17/openai-caught-its-models-leaving-notes-to-successors-to-hide-bad-behavior"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5y1dkt069qroiqnnhxz778","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmu5y1dkt069qroiqnnhxz778","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5y1dkt069qroiqnnhxz778","published_at":"2026-09-17T19:49:41.095000Z","ref":"A7","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","summary":"Anthropic 发布研究，让 Claude 在不到四周内优化了 30 多个开源生物分子模型，平均提速约 4 倍，输出完全一致时约 2 倍。","title":"Anthropic 用 Claude 优化 30 多个开源生物分子模型，平均提速约 4 倍并开源全部代码","title_en":"How Claude is uplifting biomolecular modeling","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-uplifts-biomolecular-modeling"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5y1e61069vroiq1klswjin","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmu5y1e61069vroiq1klswjin","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5y1e61069vroiq1klswjin","published_at":"2026-09-17T19:46:08Z","ref":"A8","score":80,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"纽约时报诉 OpenAI 与微软版权案的新解封文件披露，微软高管 Brent Hecht 在内部备忘录中称 AI 抓取是\"人类历史上最大规模的劳动窃取\"，OpenAI 高管 Nick Turley 则称聊天机器人对出版商构成\"生存威胁\"。","title":"纽约时报诉 OpenAI 与微软案解封文件披露 AI 抓取被称为史上最大劳动窃取","title_en":"Microsoft exec called AI scraping 'the largest theft of labor in human history，' new unredacted filings reveal","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/17/microsoft-exec-called-ai-scraping-the-largest-theft-of-labor-in-human-history-new-unredacted-filings-reveal"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5y1e4p069troiqnxafqf0v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cmu5y1e4p069troiqnxafqf0v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5y1e4p069troiqnxafqf0v","published_at":"2026-09-17T19:28:24Z","ref":"A9","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"The Verge 梳理近期 AI 安全与放缓争论：Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei 发文提出三步走计划，包括引入第三方评估机构（Anthropic 已单方面承诺第一步）、民主国家前沿 AI 公司协调标准，以及政府间全球协调，OpenAI 的 Sam Altman 与 Elon Musk 表示支持。","title":"The Verge 汇总 AI 超级智能放缓争论：Amodei 倡议放缓，Altman、Musk 附议，Meta 反对","title_en":"The AI Superintelligence Slowdown","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/996923/ai-safety-slow-openai-anthropic"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5tujnp0jvoroqoq64oqnjr","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmu5tujnp0jvoroqoq64oqnjr","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5tujnp0jvoroqoq64oqnjr","published_at":"2026-09-17T17:52:08.951000Z","ref":"A10","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"Claude：Blog（网页）","summary":"Anthropic 重构 Claude Code 的 Projects，用户设定目标后由 Claude 拆解任务、并行调度多个线程、审查输出并汇总结果，线程本质上是各自独立分支的 Claude Code 云端会话。","title":"Claude Code 重构 Projects：从文件夹变为可托管多线程的对话式项目","title_en":"Projects redesigned： from folder to conversation","url":"https://claude.com/blog/projects-redesigned"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5smj860insroqokcuh0u9v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"cmu5smj860insroqokcuh0u9v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5smj860insroqokcuh0u9v","published_at":"2026-09-17T17:18:08.568000Z","ref":"A11","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"Qwen：Blog Retrieval（API）","summary":"Qwen 发布下一代原生全模态模型 Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash，支持文本、图像、音频和视频输入及 1M token 上下文窗口，29 项评测平均分较 Qwen3.5-Omni-Plus 提升超过 25%，音频输入每小时价格下降超过 98%，音视频输入每小时价格下降超过 93%。","title":"Qwen 发布原生全模态模型 Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash，主打音视频智能体任务交付","title_en":"Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash： Omni Senses. Agentic Delivery.","url":"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen3.8-omni-flash"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5r7kl30h35roqonpk4qypn","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmu5r7kl30h35roqonpk4qypn","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cmu5r7kl30h35roqonpk4qypn","published_at":"2026-09-17T16:38:32.383000Z","ref":"A12","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"Goodfi